// 分析节黄金用例：跨模块——导入名、导入的函数与泛型函数、struct、enum 与顶层绑定在使用处解到定义模块的声明。
import { Point, Color, LIMIT, makePoint, pick } from "./data/ana_lib";

function shade(c: Color): int {
    return switch (c) {
        case Red => 1,
        case Green => 2,
    };
}

function main(args: []string): int {
    const p: Point = makePoint(1, 2);
    const q = Point { x: p.y, y: p.x };
    const c = pick(Color.Red, Color.Green, true);
    return pick(p.x, q.x, false) + shade(c) + LIMIT;
}
